					"nextDialogs": [
						750220607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220607,
					"content": "（咕——）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的匿叶龙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220608,
					"content": "咦，难道是肚子饿了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220609,
					"content": "它一只龙孤零零地在这里，主人也不见了，估计也没有办法自己去觅食…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220610,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，我们找点吃的喂给它吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220611,
					"content": "等它吃饱了乖乖让开，宝藏就是我们的啦，嘿嘿…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220612,
					"content": "喂它点什么好呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750220613,
					"content": "让我想想，纳塔这边的龙好像什么都会吃一点，也不知道匿叶龙都喜欢吃什么，看它的颜色，总觉得会喜欢吃什么草啊，叶子什么的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220614,
					"content": "先简单找一样试试看好了，饿了的家伙，大概不会挑食吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
